  "description": "Native C# NFS server hosting surface (ONC RPC, MOUNT v3, NFSv3, NFSv4.x) with a built-in local file system backend, pluggable host capabilities including SETATTR attribute mutation, and an embeddable OpenNfsServerApplication suitable for in-process test servers. Alpha.",
  "id": "OpenNFS.Server",
  "isPrerelease": false,
